message: >-
  If you use clingox in your work, please cite it with the metadata below. Please
  also cite clingo, the system clingox binds, with the reference listed under
  "references".
title: clingox
abstract: >-
  Rust bindings to clingo, the answer set programming system from the Potassco
  project, with a vendored build of clingo 5.8.2.
